          "date_decided": "1992-03-25",
          "holding": "The Supreme Court held that the Adoption Assistance and Child Welfare Act's requirement that a state plan provide for reasonable efforts to prevent removal and enable return creates no privately enforceable right, either implied under the Act or through 42 U.S.C. § 1983.",
